---
import NordicBorder from './ui/NordicBorder.astro';
---
<section id="about" class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8 text-center text-nordic-gold">Tale of the Developer</h2>
        <NordicBorder class="p-8 bg-nordic-dark/50 backdrop-blur-sm">
            <p class="text-nordic-silver mb-6 text-lg">
                A wanderer in the realm of code, I forge digital solutions with the precision of a master craftsman.
                My journey spans the lands of Backend and SRE, wielding modern technologies as my tools of trade.
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-8">
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <div class="rune">🛡️</div>
                    <h3 class="text-nordic-gold font-bold">Backend</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-nordic-silver/80">Node.js/Express, Python</p>
                </div>
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <div class="rune">⚒️</div>
                    <h3 class="text-nordic-gold font-bold">DevOps</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-nordic-silver/80">Docker, Podman, AWS, CI/CD, Shell scripting</p>
                </div>
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <div class="rune">📜</div>
                    <h3 class="text-nordic-gold font-bold">Database</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-nordic-silver/80">PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis, Athena, AWS SQS</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </NordicBorder>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .skill-card {
        @apply p-4 text-center border border-nordic-gold/30 hover:border-nordic-gold transition-colors duration-300;
    }
    .rune {
        @apply text-3xl mb-2;
    }
</style>